  "title": "Unified payments research 2026",
  "summary": "Unified payments research 2026 melody_admin Mon, 05/18/2026 - 11:46 Image Vontier's new research shows that fragmented payment systems are creating costly delays for convenience retailers. Recent survey results show that retailers using more unified payment ecosystems are more likely to report smooth, cost-effective upgrades. Learn how unifying payment infrastructure reduces complexity, lowers costs, strengthens loyalty and accelerates growth from the forecourt to the C-store. File Document Unified_Payment_Research_May_2026_Final.pdf Document Type Report",
